  "nativeMetadataFlow": {
    "fileTime": "Successful classification file loader50840a->40b1d0->40b784->storeDouble+4e1;programmatic path50b405same. File-age reads attributes+20=ftLastWriteTime,converts via FileTimeToLocalFileTime then FileTimeToDosDateTime. DOS words then feed date/time encoders. Time comes from filesystem,not SP/SSP body or acquisition clock.",
    "lookup": "50b1dc pushes classifier+4e1/+4e5 to54a73c. Exact-ID existing row returns unchanged;time arguments only copied by54a814oncreation. RA/Dec are separately overwritten from spectrum+31/+3b. Reuse is therefore not a newly timestamped measurement.",
    "initialValues": "54a814clears RA/Dec,fiveExtendedphotometry,packedtype,ZandV;sets kind from globaloption+2e7f,andemptyremarks length. These are initial values/sentinels,not measured truth or permission to fill unavailable fields.",
    "padding": "403c5ccopies min(length,capacity) text bytes and one length. Record creation does not clear every byte of its144byte stack buffer;emptyremarks initializes only its length. Full-byte zero initialization/deterministic padding/original writer byte equivalence is not established.",
    "photometry": "Separate caller501e9c..501f8bpasses owner measurement-struct+620time through prepare,conditionallyfillscoordinates,kind+67e,five nonzero Extendedslots+64c. This is not the classifier practice source path.",
    "redshift": "Separate caller5839cd..583a6fwrites manual/current Extended+49f intorecordZSingle,coordinatesfromspectrum,andconditionalVphotometryfromspectrum+45. It does not establish authority from a header claim or catalog answer.",
    "dateDisplay": "487bccadds rawDouble,dateobjectExtended+2a andglobal5bad48. Offsetsetter487b2cstores suppliedSinglehours/24. Startup helper40d47cuses GetLocalTime before100000threshold branch;stored record does not carry original host clock/zone/offset. 40d1b8usesGregorianordinal-693594,matching1899-12-30butnotproving an arbitraryDATUTCepoch/context."
  },
